The '''Crystal Barrier''' is a giant blue crystal that is located in [[Snowhill]]. It is what sealed off the [[Elves]] from [[Dwarves|the]] [[Human|other]] [[Pixies|races]] during the [[Unbinding]]. The barrier is believe to be the gateway to the other side of the mountain which is [[Silver Hills]]. An elderly [[Pixies|pixie]], named [[Silversnow]], waited in front of the Crystal Barrier for it to opened and to be reunited with the other elves. But it never opened before ''[[Free Realms]]'' was [[Sunset of Free Realms|shut down]].

